  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/zipball/v8.127.0",
  "body": ">[!IMPORTANT]\r\n> For Python 3.8 and 3.9: `dd-trace-py` version is [v3.19.8](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/releases/tag/v3.19.8)\r\n> For Python >= 3.10: `dd-trace-py` version is [v4.12.2](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/releases/tag/v4.12.2)\r\n\r\n\r\n>[!IMPORTANT]\r\n> This layer is currently unavailable in aws region `me-south-1`, due to unrelated incidents\r\n\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* fix: activate venv in publish_pypi.sh by @joeyzhao2018 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/842\r\n* Add ap-east-2 and ap-southeast-6 to supported regions by @jcstorms1 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/844\r\n* Guard against non-dict Payload in is_step_function_event by @purple4reina in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/846\r\n* Fix an issue where a replayed durable operation that had failed permanently reported incorrect aws.durable.replayed and aws.durable.operation_attempt tag values\r\n* release 8.127.0 by @joeyzhao2018 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/849\r\n\r\n\r\n### Layers\r\n```\r\n# AWS Commercial\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python38:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python38-ARM:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python39:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python39-ARM:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python310:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python310-ARM:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python311:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python311-ARM:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python312:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python312-ARM:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python313:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python313-ARM:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python314:127\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python314-ARM:127\r\n\r\n# AWS GovCloud \r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python38:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python38-ARM:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python39:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python39-ARM:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python310:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python310-ARM:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python311:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python311-ARM:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python312:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python312-ARM:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python313:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python313-ARM:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python314:127\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python314-ARM:127\r\n\r\nACCOUNT =\r\n002406178527 for us1 environment\r\n486696501492 for us2 environment\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/compare/v8.126.0...v8.127.0",
